# A plain router/AP image without the UniFi-adoption dependencies or SQM, for
# anyone who does not want this router to become a managed UniFi AP and would
# rather not carry the extra packages. Flash headroom is not a concern on this
# device (128 MB NAND, ~9 MB base image - see README), so this profile exists
# for a leaner install, not because space is tight.
-hostapd-utils
-kmod-nft-bridge
-kmod-veth
-sqm-scripts
-luci-app-sqm
-htop
-tcpdump
